  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "清懦行賈，徑陟山阻。與狄為市，不憂危殆。利得十倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e19e6f0503c4bc1ee33f2c913910e1eee75b4a25f57b5937e4813b9dbc7886fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0fa3df7a8ceab694a1fa54ed39f1685ea9c3a6ff0e5ab2f1ded625cc7789f7eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "鼎足承德，嘉謀生福。為王開庭，得心所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b070f8c7084d3c5dbd1bf218c15b17210607b608cee3fcef9a64b005f54caf73",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d1cd760ee83cccdec13a0cbc91115cfebf0761f885ddf8235cd9a41c88a02e24"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "曳綸江海，釣魴與鯉。王孫列俎，以饗仲友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47fc50994ce00ba498f416a36e8f75ac8266fce1881c2210473f61a7844ffd4f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:819ff38d8504461122fbeaddf679ba0d6f5a6fe1dfcce223808b0332d410b577"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "東山皋落，叛逆不服。興師征討，恭子敗覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f77c4bf039004eeb222ab37639d96e1fed3a8bd32063b589911729b31657d3f7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ac0161b269163bbce3f927c84a05010ee1f68bb82b8a19ba317f8b09c34c1ba6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "千里騂駒，為王服車。嘉其驪榮，君子有成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d993bedbd21d3210d40cbb42f9465d274f486a2de7704cc26b7d165d8af0d710",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ed10baf3e4ee1642cb90d1c56d6846cde44e6d653bf6d56259bd88b6fabf5e7e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "三龍北行，道逢六狼。莫宿中澤，為禍所傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d4b0e2ff10de8e1ca980eb9729c0aae24139a7e49c2532a1624bcd5bfc496f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e908f130777634eff5044364e217cc10b4d4038e1e91543eb6c7068b9b23d2d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "天災所遊，凶不可居。轉徙獲福，留止危憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bfb361f33383d9e68af42f6afe2b0d1c8d4a5e08bfba1db1a2053de945934e53",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7835c260ca09064b05a888363d8db598183148487576a8ae0a017dedf6d0837c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "狐狸雉兔，畏人逃去。分走竄匿，不知所處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f899c168dc6dafe69fc76d5ea919db4a219d49173c19ffba6a4bd9cfa207ade1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fec123db47b6bf6b4eff4a4c442f7bac3d35d4d2e79aa75c3a7f502dd418673a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "雨師娶婦，黃巖季子。成禮既婚，相呼南上。膏潤下土，年歲大有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:49c0d7df2102aa95cda2c665b6a4da76dcfe08b10961a16897150b6d884f3b37",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b169c5e32ff77587d26bd882444cf3a013f50cf047d4936198d2e40295b2dbc1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "外棲野鼠，與雉為伍。瘡痍不息，即去其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6de7434b140d503f3fbcd4ec11b2cfa99dc0d4a1a21c1542262cf3b300a52054",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:979239d12ae32f7dbf0c0d4fba30ecb1f3018a9fd78d865ff3a898879183f8f4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "天命絕後，孤傷無主。徬徨兩社，獨不得酒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3015eb73f200b3412e184c36c70f1ea43e1e9fd5e4ebe59fecfa0e31a8ccf9ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:024ff0c37a53a9cfb0423e0f93899559a258021a44b66e5e07f9d0bc241dc9ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "鵠思其雄，欲隨鳳東。順理羽翼，出次日中。傾流北邑，反復其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0e364eebee451fbc90b99838b06fbaa000e7e429e778f35ace194157fd5fb993",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a7de9e814bce438f9ea313b29cdd266f082962c271352784ddfd369c16f3d6bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "蜲蛇九子，長尾不殆。均明光澤，燕自受福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7068831f823298fe84f23abe02125bf0d8ab5b2d2b0e5ec6e4eade400c3e32fa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d50c49f1916b994b7cf179818a076669f9035564699174a4dc9afe532f2b7a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "日走月步，趨不同舍。夫妻反目，君主失國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:298bed04077d83c973584e48b9840973e59d5f20f845921c4a7f2b7aa7af2355",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:230e94d76a1b00c0cdb3d1e35f849aea733fa385a6f28806912c34d5ed246e27"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "定房戶室，括薪除毒。文德淵府，害不能賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:73fea04a1efd435eda76438028de76751d246b824f9e6df196a3c03e71fc50eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:793e02b32d41bff8aca063417575b62bafa4244e30a2468536d031aafa3a2ca4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "東齊郭廬，嫁于洛都。駿良美好，多好讓主。利得過倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6c9606370e7d41f2b09b98dc9fa9cb3bebea8e0c1f2d19ff03c333920018a60f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c9d5f4023990e37380ed4082bce4c4f9b4256ec6762c41352469398e85ee1f45"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "病篤難醫，和不能治。命期終訖，下既蒿里。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d252b2b6c0d7501707465f6252bb59d4042cc823f93580267825b0c11d9b39e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:73d92af99588e554ebc338221813b044b1bbdc272dc9ffb04399562a973bd691"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "開郭聚業，王跡所起。姬德七百，振以八子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:344ad0d8a8eb5c920ec662efb3d64bc8aa58722c25972da2958ba425f3217463",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c41959e47db97146848f86074d8d88ca5599b2824bc7bdd60167dc9024258b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "豐年多儲，河海饒魚。商客善賈，大國富有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e263698220e871f79181b2a26e4c66a0aa752785c31dfdcfe3dfb428c6617cc6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5360023f4d3a37cd99b62719d2fa3359d3dda817a349bfd61a22fa548d412c22"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "鵠求魚食，過彼食邑。繒加我頸，繳挂羽翼。欲飛不能，為羿所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f0245e1c4c8ea0597c38df6a8077cfbd184e2096dbbb9926bb0891d3986702d8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5af130b26016d4121e53b25dd86af04ed3eaa586392472b38434e00fa4ab89a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "望城抱子，見邑不殆。公孫上堂，文君悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2be971fd2e90d8bff05b2cfeac83d6d395e0ac213b458f286d3c85fd6e64637",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13c9d850c98ff1c5d979ffc6b67b622e21cd74c30db547473056cec586b61400"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "左指右麾，邪侈靡靡。執節無良，靈君以亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec65add1ebb6166d1425bfb084e89880e58c002251a2150c2649d0dca908f537",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0803e2922a0ea95290c46dc3697f33380449bc4fb30f35ce06671477f215a322"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "日中為市，各持所有。交易資賄，函珠懷寶。心悅歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b7a8d6a64e4aeb5a1dca45cdd9f814fdb09facdbdc87d5461eb3db90abad3409",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d2f9aece479bc45fb2eabc9385eda6920f48e4d6c0b9fa106a4c07927295559c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "山沒丘浮，陸為水魚，燕雀無廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4727441a0cda40d92457800fbf3c3b66b0eb87108f482c8dcd9a5e4f6131cc49",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:afef1b74122f6db934301affa1dc15e8766b89552380d8637a5ad05daaad7dea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "馬服長股，宜行善市。蒙祐諧偈，獲利五倍。一作終日在市，詰朝獲利。既享嘉福，得久乃幾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0e971a360a75b3685503892c9d971048fb79bfa780af6c28271aa35edff16fb7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ec01f31ee5896d51f1848906e6084dee433c11f9053c86e709309aada23e73b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "三狸捕鼠，遮遏前後。死於國城，不得脫走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1a28c63e3de14343784c34a32415246d832d87843fc08cdda5ce9410fa651e2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09b82f197e6c43b980a8cfd537d0dd80e2984dc3281bc64e9a7e35d7e190f661"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "鬼舞國社，歲樂民喜。臣禮於君，子孝於父。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:513d2949d6f73dbe347e882397e8f5705bf4bdfce35d12b171244bc188520625",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:33cabd932ba8521e7cc655b026a6a25c411dc59d6d6ea8f8ce42f69ca1438c53"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "慈母望子，遙思不已。久客外野，我心悲苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36bb07ba8a444bbab98d8887143fd6fa77af41dabab23cd0ee3105e2187c4e41",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:792f60847a9363a51e0104543c24c370cf18ee0854dcd36497f8d3444dc7359a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "雨師娶婦，黃巖季子。成禮既婚，相呼南上。膏潤下土，年歲大有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e59ffeb086e8c0c7e90cb5161b347f12ab70f1a06576d1256e211d15c9c42292",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b169c5e32ff77587d26bd882444cf3a013f50cf047d4936198d2e40295b2dbc1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "兩狗圍室，相咬爭食。枉矢西流，射我暴國。高宗伐鬼，三年乃服。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0bb3eae269a74d34ef355db7b8b19d21853b2f1ba1a0cd682f8a928932a3abb8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dfab83b3a300e7f56323b76d2a0ed5ad1128e4e20ae6c2c851843716081a4ff8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "早霜晚雪，傷禾害黍。損功棄力，飢無可食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a352f32e8403331880706ee456f1a4d18ef0c008e192bf1d707f4a209b56e115",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dbb7168f0c6d71a8ceaf2d3d6faf6d9ef779d286f713cf588a8629ce3f493610"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "腐臭何在，青蠅集聚。變白為黑，敗亂邦國。君為臣逐，失其寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a399d7ab4e8b40b8494d6f73d8f4ef2f55d754b597a03d9084e6fbbf8cb5bd2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71267ba1982828b1a4dc584f0fe7c6b2c5ce3996b1c2114e2ca0ada4ac204b1f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "牽羊不前，與心戾旋。聞言不信，誤紿丈人。一云言語不富，誤詒丈人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38aa946ab0f8446bc0d8ebca828774f93437802eceacd671edfd8b90afee413d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:55d6efee1798971eb17e7f3b328df7895c306c3854c5e9563f15c1c88f7198be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "甘忍利害，還相克敵。商子酷刑，鞅喪厥身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4426a71f176a5c5ad150f983f350873a17c9b97175808600e7e444d762fdb819",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:328ecee4ac5de630e5e433a1fbfc5baf25edf2a06c2107b659c02c011443d0f5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "刲羊不當，血少無羹。女執空筐，不得桑根。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0318b03f2f9f073e7d9afe0b1a7122dee44121d42f6dbf39f0a705b435064294",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce1ecd460ce4d24ef82d628089054d5abc8ecacd4ca095ab5810b737a0cf90a5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "，貧鬼相責。無有歡怡，一日九結",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4182eb79e7ddf7880f5c81599e0441c97c734a35b0c3c5eba077735b6f6d5292",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebb19059539e30f461130ac0397c672b5f300ee51e67dd84af1b564ace4db36e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "兩足四翼，飛入嘉國。寧我伯姊，子母相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f41ba98993ed7d926f22d29e134ad2a552483e8592e2b21736a60974f5365ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2db0077c6f64b05902a0c6cee931f3494e85696082a7df390f414d8cdff89e7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "文山紫芝，雍梁朱草。生長和氣，王以為寶。公尸侑食，福祿來處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f742ba08809a47ef874d7a73d6568c3fad85dd485854a56cce3673001af34250",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2117f400e95e63dfbc42334e991f9f0730c0a0921af078be2b697ade68b0b6cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "絕世遊魂，福祿不存。精神渙散，離其躬身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:acb2222488a62b0b8ee40538ad326c78c156d24ed8f0b3c6a4823c1c77a97af2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c7be993f3304066c7186fcdd64ecfca9bddbef35ce66fa009d389d00cb5d3b64"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "北辰紫宮，衣冠立中。含弘建德，常受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1a7c36aa84e7556009637867f531ffd8a73236a9bf1d4b7789d294c066f194c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d3bc9965fbf98cafc933837f1c3c7b9597e66c7bc0564f86cf9489bcae73b55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "伯蹇叔盲，莫為守株。失我衣裘，代爾陰鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d9cfa295b9e2a69aa76bc6894c396e8fe754fd38d03fafb84036bb77425ff4c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f38e23076782c177503bc18ff7d3dd87e440c480643fa6036214e7a218c7778a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "兩女共室，心不聊食。亂髮如蓬，憂常在中。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b0497f6a3977563eb7a85b3efffe3adafc1f0684e74ae8fb8bcf181789a90f29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4605acf39849921151231db81d30b90e998c9ecd3a3a3914e7003ac44ac0758"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "去辛就蓼，毒愈酷甚。避宑遇坑，憂患日生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57d3fe6016d84814aa483150e5031655d907190560bb4c8bfc7820f2efdf1642",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39d27d610745e1d6f78dce9067944fc94563366297482bb1b14b6fa87b09b5e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "初病終凶，季為死喪，不見光明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c7bd3031240c0c90f067afd1c3aaddf831d8bb93586de268fdb89c7ca2037d3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e990fd91d3ffc592babe4be6785d7a4775303e3f76ece4e34dc76199b4cd3f87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "三鳥飛來，自到逢時。俱行先至，多得大利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eee18f3922ea8c9c6f6516dff95c96ae9622176823b07f0aed6ace4a998f7c95",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1b378b0c109c97f8f6bc7e07bc11eb5d81ee8d8ee52f7a408b8ed80b127124a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "鹿食山草，不思邑里，雖久無咎",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:138c2b71384b563f67cc68e0972fb948a9e160d099db16b4c1ff62a834eada8c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d279f83a073b5f0734a710beed15f124587d6c2eb59b150706340433f3437321"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "羊腸九縈，相催併前。止須王孫，乃能上天。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e6c9f1b5fb3b62e9c84e1f8ef11daf18c88603eeabbe8c42d58d9e75e804f94",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7e19ed58ef2d3171b23de970d1b540f00e19a4ee754cf119baca0f8c706b95d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "管仲遇桓，得其願歡。膠日殺糾，振冠無憂。笑戲不莊，空言妄行。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b0e6b50e2a5a2512dae6e9fc6fcee6006281f9d2efc0e22a713ac898e8110585",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f65ded33b5b3433ce1dd938781eaf901c1f4ab5a18f1a393b0d0893d621b1234"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "桀跖並處，民困愁苦。旅行遲遲，留連齊魯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18a7eb8270d4a2a8c2dbf0c07d7e82e63d30479140237c1d392d372971d2778b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:95cc5e036087d1c5bdcb2c43458894a9f3ed66771ef9a00153ddfc742dfd874e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "魂孤無室，銜損不食。盜張氏饋，見敵失肉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a194a570ff5813d71bc49aaff12ddf35ca1f222ce17ef5b5ba30d6bfaf37066",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:983aabed90d6448706091da68e79ca3f6238f449af362021f3f7d060a85a1168"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "讒言亂國，覆是為非。伯奇乖離，恭子憂哀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c207e21228b4d00d4dc6f199fce1397bae791ddf514a81223cefa4bce386530",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:87aa2cf2e82ec985bdc7efac10229b27cd627ec6dbd0fa0abcb9fab1ae3c4b64"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "衛侯東遊，惑於少姬。亡我考妣，久迷不來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fe1708130845d0bf90bf12805be8255a60de31219b6714439242ebb90806149",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebbf1ab62e3e069b1582e1e1bd280e227083773d3269ad6f95ff51061d585bf1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "雞鳴同興，思配無家。執佩持鳧，莫使致之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8eaac0e96223022b5c1eddd09345d8f15ae7fcdbb8b7688deee9db3e578f68e9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7ea77161231b62a58511e41d12ab546869c23b39eff1446aee5fcf92d98a3f38"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "義不勝情，以欲自縈。覬利危躬，催角折頸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e9c774298b8b4c10e7ce82aa3da3345ea3964ae3da1d2a8b0a1031849196e05a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d04e6809ceb243b73e09f1ebfe90243ff47e69e60fff38d3095dd8d3ff8606ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "臣尊主卑，權力日衰。侵奪無光，三家逐公。升之巽）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f1f382f0e74ff5784d4bff6651f3638baf8f3f03a95d7525517316f19b9492b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c285f54d5c6cc1c86eecff0020232f6d660e5b3f7ba61b4546c93d6447b48244"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "叔仲善賈，與喜為市。不憂危殆，利得十倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3fa77e6b925589abff9509470917de9b7b362692812dbe10816266323966223d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:953ef9ee177dd2c951e2dca81c90dc90d4edb6bc5abe34dbbb3b875dd4a6312c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "六蛇奔走，俱入茂草。驚於長路，畏懼啄口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3fba450dd5c3d34ded47dbccf97b6006ef11e8705209d7e5beb938bdfa29c7dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:578ea9c654eccb9ea657d29d068102468e3c383ecc3a6c19969fc541980add3c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "水壞我里，東流為海。鳧虌讙囂，不可安居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fcaff7ea52e48329631e87090d07061c858bddf791ca4888c7495ea8fa135943",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2dc75420150276152c66bde481a7dadb74f3332586eebe41db2902f88266ba9f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "飛不遠去，卑廝內侍，祿食未富。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c99d01485badb65a44f865c46e51d9125662a1e5488c226177278ce6e53e0ae4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6374f7ff87ecb0a65e31419df2f98a48e7ee84cddb2c8b498d8031ec24f79659"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "陰變為陽，女化為男。治道大通，君臣相承。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c18f5003acc53ef8f83bf9d4046cc097609e3514bee82544ad2293dbd8a9bdc7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b416e3d09ddacc7ec2877f0d96054525046c85555e68771bb5626deb7829fae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "踐履危難，脫厄去患。入福喜門，見誨大君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20ea313d3da5571fdab6d242ad83c1359d4ee5161353b8f7c909e89ace447d4b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b43d835b4cf7933e71d9c2b1399d5134fed5d2b6e33ae77dbc1ce514a768f541"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "網密綱縮，動益蹙急，困不得息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1457b7d4c67caa47e6de7282eeba530fa936f13a8918e6c1e3e8c1d11204d9d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b613c7dacbf8185b7aa38676d8f13ae2140f2b0520f5bff65b495924e10241c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "負牛上山，力劣行難。烈風雨雪，遮遏我前。中道復還，憂者得歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bd6c81fca34130cc48fd0e36694ce11e74665f0be2f5308d412d9b795b3856f0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa43073fa503090cb1360c8e605ddaa7cbcca137a1ddacee5c338ee9aaff7139"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 55,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "喁喁嘉草，思降甘雨。景風升上，沾洽時澍，生我禾稼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8675f21a0f6c08b921df34490bdd7e9c01ea3d1a63932c3239d0e47bab8f7e41",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c437eb0d2030922c9a9837768fb17fef3c70069c26252cc23bc4ee6a543dc968"
    }
  ]
}
